WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.482
Your profile is yours to change now, right on the page.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.689
Choose Edit profile, or Add a bio on a new profile. The dialog, built from the

00:00:12.689 --> 00:00:17.618
design system's own components, opens with what you have, ready at your name.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.164
Your home church stays hidden from other members, unless you tick the box to show

00:00:22.164 --> 00:00:22.618
it.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.530
Save changes, and your profile shows the new values at once, on phone and desktop.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.856
Clear your name, write more than three hundred characters, or list a sixth goal, and

00:00:40.856 --> 00:00:44.047
the dialog names each one before anything is sent.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.101
If a save is refused, or never answered, the dialog stays open and keeps everything

00:00:51.101 --> 00:00:52.016
you typed.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.649
Only you can change your profile. A request for anyone else's is refused as

00:01:00.649 --> 00:01:02.871
forbidden, and nothing changes.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.701
Next, slice nineteen point one: another member's profile.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.974
That's slice eighteen point two. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health

00:01:22.974 --> 00:01:24.399
in body and spirit.
